  "details": "Friend locations continue to be displayed inconsistently from their actual location. In the attached pictures the user _midi is shown in the friends wing as being in a different private instance, but she is actually sitting right next to me in the same instance. The user nick o⁄ is in the instance as well, and they are shown properly in the friends wing.\n\nThese pictures were taken on the latest open beta build so I'm submitting the bug report under the OB category, but this bug has been occurring for a long time (at least months), and I don't think it's actually specific to OB. It happens for many users on many different worlds.\n\nIt was an Invite+ instance if that matters, but I commonly see the same behavior in Friends+ as well",
